# Local development secrets for the Cloudflare Worker (`wrangler dev`).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (which is gitignored). These are ONLY used locally —
# production secrets are set with `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>`.
#
# SLAMS_JWT_SECRET: secret used to sign session JWTs. Must be a long,
# random string (>= 32 chars). Never commit it.
SLAMS_JWT_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string-at-least-32-chars
